config RA9530_CHARGER
	tristate "Renesas RA9530 wireless power transmitter (stylus charger)"
	depends on I2C
	depends on GPIOLIB || COMPILE_TEST
	select POWER_SUPPLY
	help
	  Driver for the Renesas RA9530 (and the closely related IDT P9xxx
	  family) wireless power transmitter, used in "WattShare" TRx mode to
	  charge the active stylus of tablets such as the Xiaomi Book S 12.4.

	  The chip is driven entirely over I2C; the reverse-mode foreign
	  object detection threshold is programmed before transmit is enabled.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will be
	  called ra9530-charger.
